{"id":"ugc/5e615c4c","th":"f82d034a","dur":44.209,"scenes":[{"kind":"intro","label":null,"heading":"Building an efficient shoot-and-edit workflow","t0":0.35,"t1":7.298,"sents":[{"t0":0.35,"t1":2.629,"d":"Building an efficient shoot-and-edit workflow","w":[0.373,0.76,0.871,1.313,2.031]},{"t0":2.869,"t1":7.298,"d":"A repeatable workflow is what lets you scale past a handful of clients a month.","w":[2.896,3.058,3.649,4.133,4.24,4.455,4.724,4.885,5.208,5.477,5.638,6.068,6.176,6.659,6.821]}]},{"kind":"point","label":null,"heading":"Batch shooting and editing","t0":7.918,"t1":20.217,"sents":[{"t0":7.918,"t1":20.217,"d":"Batching similar tasks — shooting several concepts in one session, then editing them all in a following block — is significantly more efficient than treating each brief as a fully separate project from scratch.","w":[7.94,8.385,8.83,9.211,9.402,9.847,10.292,10.928,11.118,11.372,11.754,12.008,12.453,12.707,12.961,13.152,13.343,13.915,14.296,14.487,14.614,15.504,15.821,16.33,16.52,17.029,17.347,17.728,17.855,18.046,18.364,18.808,19.444,19.698],"p":[[0,"📦","Batch similar tasks","do"],[4,"🎥","Shoot in batches","do"],[11,"✂️","Edit in blocks","do"]]}],"ic":"📝"},{"kind":"point","label":null,"heading":"Use personal templates","t0":20.837,"t1":32.693,"sents":[{"t0":20.837,"t1":32.693,"d":"Building a simple personal template for captions, hooks, and pacing that you adapt per brief (rather than starting from a blank page every time) speeds up both shooting and editing considerably.","w":[20.862,21.334,21.537,22.009,22.616,23.156,23.426,23.966,24.304,24.506,24.979,25.249,25.451,25.856,26.059,26.464,26.801,27.004,27.611,27.881,28.084,28.489,28.894,29.231,29.569,30.041,30.244,30.581,31.054,31.256,31.729],"p":[[4,"📋","Build a template","do"],[7,"🪝","Captions hooks pacing","key"],[20,"📄","No blank starts","no"]]}],"ic":"🗓️"},{"kind":"point","label":null,"heading":"Time each stage","t0":33.313,"t1":43.659,"sents":[{"t0":33.313,"t1":43.659,"d":"Tracking how long each stag